Guys,
I never really played rangers before, so this was the first time ever I
made it to the quest. Most of it was a piece of cake, the centaurs and
scorpions were a joke with my current weapons and AC. Even Scorpio was a
piece of cake - or so it seemed. 
 He attacked me, and when I beat him, he teleported to the staircase up.
The staircase in sight, I was too lazy to move and gave him with my
longbow what he deserved. A ridiculously low number of shots later the
lamer collapses, cursing me with his last breath.
 So what? I thought, let him curse me as he wants, I'm a dangerous dude, I
have lots of enemies, and one curse more or less won't make a difference.
How wrong I was, because as I was still cleaning up his throneroom, I
suddenly get the dreaded message of doom: DYWYPI?

Now, can anybody tell me what happened? It could not have been my lack of
poison resistance, as that would have gotten me killed long before with
all the scorpions around. I'm also pretty sure I did not have any state
the likes of hungry/sick/blind active, so it must have been something
else... but what?

